<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- AUSHI BIBLE TRANSLATION</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Inkalata yakibili iyakwa Paulo ku bena Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 tes</para>
  <para style="mt2">Inkalata ya kibili iyakwa Paulo ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">BENA TESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="is">UBULONDOLOSHI</para>
  <para style="ip">Inklata ya kibili ku bena Tesalonika yalembelwe na paulo 1:1. Alembele iyi nkalata iyakwipipa panuma ya kulemba ikalata ya 1 Tesalonika mu mwaka wa 51 AD. Paulo alembele nishi akili mu Kolinti, ulukuta ulo atampile lwendo lwa kibili ulwa bupyungishi bwakwe Imilimo ya Batumwa 17.1-10. Kyalilembwa mu kitabo kya Milimo ya Batumwa ati mu lukuta mwali Abayuda na Bagiliki abakuti ubwingi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ulukuta lwa ku Tesalonika lwalisakamikilwe palwa nshiku sha kupelekeshako na pakwisa kwakwa Klistu pantu paulo alilembelepo ifingi pali fyo fintu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ubutantiko bwa fyabamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulo atampilapo ukuilondolola umwine pamo na balunda bakwe 1.1-2.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Elo atasha ulukuta lwa ku Tesalonika no kubapepelako.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Mu kyapita 2, Paulo alanda panshiku sha kupelekeshako.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Alanda pa kukinkintila ubunagani no kubakoselesha pa kubomba 3.1-15.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Pa kulekelesha Paulo aposhapo lukuta na kabili 3.16-18.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Nebo Paulo, Sailasi na Timote, twamilembela mwe lukuta lwa mu Tesalonika, mwe baampana na Lesa Shifwe na Shikulu Yesu Klistu. <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Ikikuuku no mutende wakwa Lesa Tata na Shikulu Yesu Klistu fibe na mwebo.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Klistu akesa kupingula abantu bonse ulo akabweluluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Mwe bawesu, fwebo tufwile ukutasha Lesa lonse fye pa mulandu wa mwebo. Ala iki ekyakulungama kuli fwebo ukukita, pantu ikiketekelo kyenu kikokulilako fye sana no kutemwana kwenu nako kukolundulukilako fye. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ekyo fwebo tulatakisha mu kulanda kwesu pali mwebo ku nkuta shakwa Lesa. Tulatakisha pafyo mwalikonkanyapo ukushipikisha no kusumina ulo bamikyusha na mumafya yene mukopitamo. <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Ala ifi fyonse filashininkisha ati Lesa wa mulinganya mukupingula. Kabili muli iki, Lesa akomilenga ati mube abakulinga mu Bufumu bwakwe, ubo mukyulila. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Lesa wa mulinganya, akakyusha aba mikyusha. <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />Akapwisha amakyushi yenu pamo na makyushi yesu yonse. Akakita iki ulo Shikulu Yesu akasokoloka ukufuma kwiulu pamo na bamalaika bakwe aba maka. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Akesa mu lubingu lwa mulilo mukukanda abo bonse abatafwaya ukwishiba Lesa na batafwaya ukunakila Imbila yakwa Shikulu Yesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Lesa akabakanda, bakaloba. Akabafumyapo, tabakabone kinso kyakwa Shikulu na maka ya bukindami bwakwe. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Pa bushiku ubo ulo akabwela, abamushilo bonse bakamulumbanya, abasumina nabo bakamukindika. Elo na mwebo bene mukaba nabo pantu mulisumine amashiwi ya bukambone bwesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Ekyo lonse fye tulamipepelako. Tulapapata Lesa wesu ati mube ne mibeele iyakulingana no bwite amikuutako. Ku maka yakwe afikilishe ifya bune fyonse efyo mufwaya ukukita no kupwilishisha imilimo yenu yonse iyo mubomba mu kisumino. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Ninshi lwena mwalekukindika Shikulu Yesu, na mwebo akulamikindika pa mulandu wa kikuuku Lesa wesu na Shikulu Yesu Klistu bamikwatila.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Umubi akasokololwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Nomba ulo Shikulu Yesu Klistu ikabwela, tukalongana uko ikaba. Kanshi tukomipapata mwe bawesu <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />ukwebati, mwilekutunsha mitima nangu ukuba no mwenso bamo nga bakolanda ati, ubushiku bwakwa Shikulu bulifikile. Limbi mukotontonkanya ati mupashi eukolanda ifyo nangu nifwe twafunda nangu tulilembele ifyo mu kalata, awe yii. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Mwileka umuntu nolo umo amibepe na panini. Ubushiku bulya tabwakafike mpaka ulo ukusangukila Lesa ukwakintu bwingi kukakitika, no mubi uwakulobelela akasokoloka. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Akaisansabalika ukukila pali fyonse ifikutwa umulungu nangu pali fyonse efyo abantu bapepa. Akengila mwitempele lyakwa Lesa akalande ati ni nebo Lesa. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Bushe tamukoibukisha? Nalimyebele fi ulo twali na mwebo. <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Kabili mulishibile ikilesha umubi ukukanasokoloka pali ino nshita. Lelo pa nshita iyakulinga umubi akasokoloka. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Kwena inkaama yakwa mpula mafunde ilabomba na kale. Lelo efyo nandile ati fikakitika, teti fikitwe kano Lesa akafumyepo uulesha ifi fintu ukukitika. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Lwena mpula mafunde akasokoloka, lelo Shikulu Yesu akesa ku mukimfisha fye ku mupu wa kukanwa kakwe, na ku kuboneka kwakwe ukwa bukindami ekukamonaula. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Uyu mpula mafunde ulo akesa, akakwata maka yakwa Satana. Akalakita ifishibilo, ifipeshamano ne fingelengwe ifya misango yonse iyabufi. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Akabomfya imisango iyakulekana lekana pakubepa abakaloba. Bakaloba, pantu balikeene ukupokelela ikishinka no kukitemwa pakwebati bapusuke. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ekyo Lesa akabatumina amaka yakubafulunganya, ayakubalenga ukusumina ifyabufi. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Kanshi abo bonse bakakwata umulandu, pantu balikeene ukusumina amashiwi yakishinka, batemwa ukukita ifyabubi.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwalisalwa ukwebati mukapusuke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Lelo fwebo lonse fye tulatasha Lesa pali mwebo mwe bawesu, mwebo Shikulu atemwa. Pantu ni mwebo Lesa asalile ukuba abakutampa mukupusuka. Alimiwemye ukuba abantu bamushilo ku maka yakwa mupashi, na pali ikyo mwalisumina mu kishinka. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Lesa ku Mbila Yabune twamishimikile, alimikuutile pakwebati mukwateko ubukindami bwakwa Shikulu Yesu Klistu. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Kanshi nomba mwe bawesu, mulekushipa. Mule kwikatilila fye ku fyakishinka ifyo twamifundile nefyo tukomilembela mu nkalata. <verse eid="2TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Shikulu Yesu Klistu umwine na Lesa Shifwe uwatutemwa, na ku kikuuku kyakwe alatupeela ikikoseleshi kya pe ne subilo ilyamaka, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />alekukoselesha imitima yenu no kumikosha pakwebati mulekubomba no kulanda ifya bune fyonse.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Mulekutupepelako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Pakulekelesha, mwebo bawesu mulekutupepelako ukwebati amashiwi yakwa Shikulu yasalangane kangu kangu no kupokelelwa no mukinshi, nge fyo mwebo mwapokelele. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Mulekupepa no kwebati Lesa alekutupokololako ku bantu ababubi na bakintomfwa. Pantu te bonse basumina.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Lelo Shikulu wakishinka alekumikosha no ku mikingilila ku bubi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Shikulu alalenga ati tulekumiketekela ati mulakonka ifyo tumyeba, kabili mwalekutwalilila ukukonka ifyo tukomyeba.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Shikulu alekumitungulula mu kwiluka ifyo Lesa amitemwa na mukushipikisha nga Klistu.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo abakonkomesha ati balekubomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Mwebo bawesu, tukomikonkomesha mwi nshina lyakwa Shikulu Yesu Klistu ati, mulekutaluka kuli bawesu bonse aba bunang'ani, abakaana ukukonka amafunde twamifundile. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Mwebo mwe bene mulishibile bwino ati mufwile ukutupashanya. Fwebo tatwali ba nang'ani ulo twali na mwebo. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Fwebo tatwalikupoka ikyakulya ku muntu nangu umo ukwakubula ukulipila. Lelo twalikubombesha sana no kukyukyutika ubwakya no bwaila pakwebati twibika muntu nangu umo mu bwafya bwakutulisha. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Twalikubombesha, te mukwebati nikyo tutakwata nsambu shakusungwa, lelo twalikukite fyo pakwebati tube ikilangililo kuli mwebo ekyo mufwile ukukonka. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Kabili ulo twali na mwebo twalimipeele ifunde ilyakwebati, “Uwakaana ukubomba, elekulya.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Tukolanda ifi, pantu twalyumfwile ati bambi pali mwebo banang'ani. Tababomba nkito, baikalila fye umulomo. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Ku maka yakwa Shikulu Yesu Klistu, tukokonkobesha abo bantu no kubeba ati, balekwikala ifyo bafwile ukwikala, balekubomba pakwebati balekuilisha abene.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Lelo mwebo mwe bawesu, mwilekutendwa ukukita ifyabune. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Umo nga akaana ukubeela aya mashiwi twamilembela muli iyi inkalata, mumwishibe bwino uyo. Mulekumutalukako uyo muntu pakwebati ekatwe nsoni. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Nomba mwile kumubona kubati mulwani yii, lelo mulekumusokako pantu ni wenu.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amashiwi ya kulekelesha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Shikulu umwine wa mutende, angamupeela umutende mu nshita yonse na muli fyonse. Shikulu alekuba na mwebo bonse.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Nebo ne Paulo nkolemba no kuboko kwangi aya mashiwi yakumiposha. Pakupwisha ukulemba inkalata yonse, ifi efyo nemba na munkalata shimbi ukulanga ati ni nebo. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Ikikuuku kyakwa Shikulu Yesu Klistu kilekuba na mwebo mwense.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>